# halui pins wired from a regular HALFILE. The startup script runs HAL files
# only after halui is ready, and configs rely on that: this must keep loading
# if halui ever moves into task.
net machine-is-on-led   halui.machine.is-on
net remote-estop        halui.estop.activate
net remote-estop-reset  halui.estop.reset
net remote-mode-mdi     halui.mode.mdi
